# Secrets & service accounts — never commit these.
# Broad on purpose: a near-miss during this repo's first commit showed
# firebase/service-account.json (no "firebase-" prefix, no hyphen) slipping
# past narrower patterns. Match anything containing "service-account" or
# "serviceaccount" (any case, any separator) at any depth.
secrets/
**/*service*account*.json
**/*ServiceAccount*.json

